{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_1","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"陰陽別論篇第七","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_2","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"黃帝問曰：人有四經，十二從，何謂？岐伯對曰：四經，應四時；十二從，應十二月；十二月應十二脈。","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_3","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"脈有陰陽，知陽者知陰，知陰者知陽。","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_4","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"凡陽有五，五五二十五陽。","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_5","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"所謂陰者，真臟也。見則為敗，敗必死也。","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_6","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"所謂陽者，胃脘之陽也。","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_7","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"別於陽者，知病處也，別於陰者，知生死之期。","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_8","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"三陽在頭，三陰在手，所謂一也。","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_9","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"別於陽者，知病忌時，別於陰者，知死生之期。","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_10","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"謹熟陰陽，無與眾謀。","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_11","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"所謂陰陽者，去者為陰，至者為陽，靜者為陰，動者為陽，遲者為陰，數者為陽。","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_12","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"凡持真脈之藏脈者，肝主懸絕急，十八日死；心至懸絕，九日死；肺至懸絕，十二日死；腎至懸絕，七日死；脾至懸絕，四日死。","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_13","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"曰：二陽之病發心脾，有不得隱曲，女子不月；其傳為風消，其傳為息賁者，死不治。","sortOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_14","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"曰：三陽為病，發寒熱，下為癰腫，及為痿厥，腨〈疒肙〉；其傳為索澤，其傳為〈疒頽〉疝。","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_15","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"曰：一陽發病，少氣，善咳，善泄；其傳為心掣，其傳為隔。","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_16","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"二陽一陰發病，主驚駭、背痛、善噫、善欠，名曰風厥。","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_17","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"二陰一陽發病，善脹、心滿善氣。","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_18","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"三陰三陽發病，為偏枯萎易，四肢不舉。","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_19","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"鼓一陽曰鉤，鼓一陰曰毛，鼓陽勝急曰絃，鼓陽至而絕曰石，陰陽相過曰溜。","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_20","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"陰爭於內，陽擾於外，魄汗未藏，四逆而起，起則熏肺，使人喘嗚。","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_21","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"陰之所生，和本曰和。","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_22","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"是故剛與剛，陽氣破散，陰氣乃消亡。","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_23","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"淖則剛柔不和，經氣乃絕。","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_24","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"死陰之屬，不過三日而死，生陽之屬，不過四日而死。","sortOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_25","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"所謂生陽死陰者，肝之心謂之生陽，心之肺謂之死陰，肺之腎謂之重陰，腎之脾謂之辟陰，死不治。","sortOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_26","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"結陽者，腫四支。","sortOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_27","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"結陰者，便血一升，再結二升，三結三升。","sortOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_28","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"陰陽結斜，多陰少陽曰石水，少腹腫。","sortOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_29","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"二陽結，謂之消。","sortOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_30","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"三陽結，謂之隔。","sortOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_31","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"三陰結，謂之水。","sortOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_32","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"一陰一陽結，謂之喉痺。","sortOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_33","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"陰搏陽別，謂之有子。","sortOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_34","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"陰陽虛，腸澼死。","sortOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_35","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"陽加於陰，謂之汗。","sortOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_36","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"陰虛陽搏，謂之崩。","sortOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_7_37","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_7","text":"三陰俱搏，二十日夜半死；二陰俱搏，十三日夕時死；一陰俱搏，十日死；三陽搏且鼓，三日死；三陰三陽俱搏，心腹滿，發盡不得隱曲，五日死；二陽俱搏，其病溫，死不治，不過十日死。","sortOrder":37}],"overrides":{}}